                    <article class="module-card"
                             data-module-card="2">

                        <div class="module-card-top">

                            <div class="technology-icon css-bg">
                                3
                            </div>

                            <span class="module-number">MÓDULO 02</span>

                        </div>

                        <h3>CSS3</h3>

                        <p>
                            Selectores, Box Model, Flexbox,
                            Grid y diseño Responsive.
                        </p>

