                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </aside>


                    <div class="theory-content">

                        <div class="theory-toolbar">

                            <span id="theoryModuleLabel">
                                MÓDULO 01
                            </span>

                            <span class="theory-reading-time"
                                  id="theoryReadingTime">
                                📖 Material de estudio
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <article id="theoryArticle"
